sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Desarrollador
    participant GW as Envoy Gateway
    participant SQ as SonarQube
    participant KC as Keycloak (realm qa)
    actor CI as Runner CI

    rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
    Note over U,KC: Personas: SAML 2.0 SP-initiated. Sin SecurityPolicy OIDC en la ruta
    U->>GW: GET https://sonar.qa.acme.com
    GW->>SQ: HTTPRoute → Service :9000
    SQ-->>U: 302 a Keycloak (AuthnRequest)
    U->>KC: login + MFA
    KC-->>U: POST SAMLResponse (login, email, groups)
    U->>GW: POST /oauth2/callback/saml
    GW->>SQ: assertion
    SQ->>SQ: valida firma con cert IdP,<br/>sincroniza grupos sonar-*
    SQ-->>U: sesión (cookie JWT-SESSION)
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over CI,SQ: Máquinas: token de análisis de proyecto, no SAML
    CI->>GW: POST /api/ce/submit<br/>Authorization: Bearer squ_…
    GW->>SQ: misma ruta, sin OIDC en el Gateway
    SQ-->>CI: task id
    CI->>SQ: GET /api/qualitygates/project_status (wait)
    SQ-->>CI: OK / ERROR → pasa o falla el job
    end
